    "description": "From how computers talk to configuring switches and routers.\n\n## What's inside\n\n- **Computer & Networking Fundamentals** - The computing and networking foundations every security role builds on. *18 lessons.*\n- **Cisco CCNA** (200-301 V2.0) - The associate networking track: addressing, switching, routing, wireless, services and security. *27 lessons.*\n\n## How lessons work\n\nEach lesson combines a written explanation with animated diagrams of the process it describes, annotated code and command-line sessions, key terms, and a short *Check your understanding* quiz. Lessons marked *coming soon* are part of the syllabus and are being written.",
